nts{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"From a compile time perspective, yes. I think it's preferable to have the detailed breakdown appear as early as possible. Here's a comparison of if the return value was `float`:\n```\n# Before\nCannot initialize a variable of type 'Error' with an rvalue of type 'float'clang(init_conversion_failed)\nStatic assertion failed due to requirement 'std::is_same_v<float, Error>': ERR_PROPAGATE expects an Error-returning expressionclang(static_assert_requirement_failed)\n\n# After\nStatic assertion failed due to requirement 'std::is_same_v<float, Error>': ERR_PROPAGATE expects an Error-returning expressionclang(static_assert_requirement_failed)\nCannot initialize a variable of type 'const Error' with an rvalue of type 'float'clang(init_conversion_failed)\n```","created_at":"2026-07-22T14:57:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T14:57:21Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121617#discussion_r3631309617","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121617","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3631309617"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121617#discussion_r3631309617"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121617"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3631309617/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":133,"original_start_line":126,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":135,"original_line":128,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3631005245,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":10,"position":10,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3631340937","pull_request_review_id":4755768290,"id":3631340